      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Portraius Studio: Recast\n\nA clip keeps its motion and camera while a character takes over, the look changes or one thing is swapped. Only use clips you filmed or have the rights to.\n\n**Motion transfer with a new setting (top row).** The \"Concert stage\" preset: MiniMax H3 performs the clip as Walt, HappyHorse moves him to a concert stage (H3 keeps the clip's setting, so the app runs this as a second step), and the clip's own audio goes back on, as the music-video presets do. Put a character's sheet and front view in `ComfyUI/input/` as `walt-sheet.jpg` and `walt-front.jpg`: unzip any `.portraius` file, they're `sheet/turnaround.png` and `sheet/front.png`. The samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`. The clip is `concert-original.mp4` from `public/samples/`.\n\n**Style swap (middle row).** The \"Claymation\" preset on the same clip, with no cast.\n\n**Object swap (bottom row).** The \"Product swap\" preset on HappyHorse: put a clip of someone holding a product in as `my-product-clip.mp4` and the replacement's sheet as `satchel-sheet.jpg`. Set the edit's ratio to your clip's shape. HappyHorse's node has no setting to keep the original audio, so the graph puts it back.\n\nH3 runs 4 to 15 s: set each H3 node's duration to your clip's length. Needs a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Portraius Studio: Recast\n\nA clip keeps its motion and camera while a character takes over, the look changes or one thing is swapped. Only use clips you filmed or have the rights to.\n\n**Motion transfer with a new setting (top row).** The \"Concert stage\" preset: MiniMax H3 performs the clip as Walt, HappyHorse moves him to a concert stage (H3 keeps the clip's setting, so the app runs this as a second step), and the clip's own audio goes back on, as the music-video presets do. Put a character's sheet and front view in `ComfyUI/input/` as `walt-sheet.jpg` and `walt-front.jpg`: unzip any `.portraius` file, they're `sheet/turnaround.png` and `sheet/front.png`. The samples are in this repo's `public/samples/`. The clip is `concert-original.mp4` from `public/samples/`.\n\n**Style swap (middle row).** The \"Claymation\" preset on the same clip, with no cast.\n\n**Object swap (bottom row).** The \"Product swap\" preset on HappyHorse: put a clip of someone holding a product in as `my-product-clip.mp4` and the replacement's sheet as `satchel-sheet.jpg`. Set the edit's ratio to your clip's shape. HappyHorse's node has no setting to keep the original audio, so the graph puts it back.\n\nH3 runs 4 to 15 s: set each H3 node's duration to your clip's length. Needs a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      }
    },
